        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-item">
        <div class="feature-icon">🍞</div>
        <div class="feature-text">
          <strong>Brioche Artesanal</strong>
          <small>Horneado a diario con mantequilla pura</small>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-item">
        <div class="feature-icon">⭐</div>
        <div class="feature-text">
          <strong>4.9 / 5 Estrellas</strong>
          <small>Más de 25,000 clientes satisfechos</small>
